## Notes
8 False Negatives – all edge cases where the healthcare setting is implied but not explicitly named.
 3 False Positives – cases where API picked up a setting signal but Freddie judged it out-of-scope.
 Overall: much improved compared to earlier runs (FN reduced, precision now very high).

Current rule generalises well across 200 articles with balanced accuracy + precision.
